OL,3,GNEWSAControlled burns warning as fire
OL,4,Acalls outs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service is urging landowners to
OL,7,Fhold off having controlled burns after
OL,8,Fhaving to put out several that got out
OL,9,Fof control.
OL,11,FCumbria Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,12,Fsince Friday, crews extinguished five
OL,13,Fcontrolled burns - a technique
OL,14,Finvolving burning old, dry vegetation
OL,15,Fin the hope of lessening the risk of
OL,16,Fwildfires.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
