OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1787757963
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAControlled burns warning as fire
OL,4,Acalls outs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FStation manager Dean Readman said some
OL,7,Fof his crews were still fighting
OL,8,Fwildfires in Wales, with others
OL,9,Fstretched to breaking point this summer
OL,10,Fas blazes spread across parts of the
OL,11,FUK.
OL,13,FThe service said while it understood
OL,14,Fcontrolled burns were used to manage
OL,15,Fsites, it asked people to postpone
OL,16,Fburns until cooler, wetter weather
OL,17,Farrives as the ground was "still very
OL,18,Fdry".
